<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>50个行为经济学概念</title>
<style>
    body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;
        background-color: #ffffff;
    }
    .header {
        background-color: #111111;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 44px;
        font-weight: 900;
        padding: 10px 20px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .container {
        padding: 0 10px;
        max-width: 850px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
    }
    .row {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
        min-height: 65px;
    }
    .term {
        width: 250px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        border-radius: 8px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.3;
        padding: 8px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .desc {
        flex-grow: 1;
        border-radius: 8px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        color: #111111;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.5;
        padding: 12px 15px 12px 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .desc ul {
        margin: 0;
        padding-left: 30px;
    }
    .desc li {
        margin: 0;
    }

    .c-orange { background-color: #f58220; }
    .c-orange-l { background-color: #ffe9dc; }

    .c-grey { background-color: #a0a0a0; }
    .c-grey-l { background-color: #ececec; }

    .c-yellow { background-color: #f9c612; }
    .c-yellow-l { background-color: #fff6d9; }

    .c-blue { background-color: #5c99d6; }
    .c-blue-l { background-color: #e6f0fa; }

    .c-green { background-color: #65b449; }
    .c-green-l { background-color: #e8f5e1; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="header">50个行为经济学概念</div>

<div class="container">

    <div class="row">
        <div class="term c-orange">
            内在动机 (Intrinsic<br>Motivation)
        </div>
        <div class="desc c-orange-l">
            <ul><li>基于内在兴趣和满足感进行行动的动机，而非外部奖励或惩罚。</li></ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="term c-grey">
            比较效用 (Relative<br>Utility)
        </div>
        <div class="desc c-grey-l">
            <ul><li>人们对于收益和满足感的评估通常是基于相对参照点的比较，而非绝对数值。</li></ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="term c-yellow">
            消费者无知<br>(Consumer<br>Ignorance)
        </div>
        <div class="desc c-yellow-l">
            <ul><li>消费者对于市场信息和产品特性的缺乏了解，导致决策受到影响。</li></ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="term c-blue">
            合作与竞争<br>(Cooperation vs.<br>Competition)
        </div>
        <div class="desc c-blue-l">
            <ul><li>人们在决策和行为中受到与他人合作或竞争的影响，从而改变决策策略。</li></ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="term c-green">
            持续效应 (Sunk Cost<br>Fallacy)
        </div>
        <div class="desc c-green-l">
            <ul><li>人们倾向于将过去已经发生的成本视为不可逆转，继续投入资源，即使当前决策并不理性。</li></ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="term c-orange">
            心理账户 (Mental<br>Account)
        </div>
        <div class="desc c-orange-l">
            <ul><li>人们对于不同资金来源的分配和使用会有不同的偏好和行为，形成不同的心理账户。</li></ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="term c-grey">
            失败回避 (Loss<br>Avoidance)
        </div>
        <div class="desc c-grey-l">
            <ul><li>人们更倾向于避免损失而非追求收益，因此在决策中可能会选择保守的选择。</li></ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="term c-yellow">
            群体迷思 (Groupthink)
        </div>
        <div class="desc c-yellow-l">
            <ul><li>在群体中，人们为了与他人保持一致和获得认同而放弃独立思考，导致决策偏差。</li></ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="term c-blue">
            时间不一致 (Time<br>Inconsistency)
        </div>
        <div class="desc c-blue-l">
            <ul><li>人们在时间跨度较长的决策中容易受到即时满足的影响，而忽视长期利益。</li></ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="term c-green">
            心理障碍<br>(Psychological<br>Barrier)
        </div>
        <div class="desc c-green-l">
            <ul><li>人们在决策中受到情绪、态度和信念等心理因素的影响，产生决策偏差。</li></ul>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
```
